<title>USA: IPO FILING-Kinetics Group Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING-Kinetics Group Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Kinetics Group Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			KNTX.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $14-$16/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.7 million</p>
